{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-idle-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.69, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-idle`: `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics`'s Year collapse (January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, road types 1 and 4, source types 21 and 62, `inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`) selecting the same gaseous species and air toxics at the OTHER exhaust processes: extended idle and auxiliary power (29 pollutants each), and crankcase running, start and extended idle (28, 28 and 27). MOVESOutput is 3,898 rows, every one source type 62's: extended idle 1,450, APU 1,148 and its shore-power retag (process 93) 50, crankcase extended idle 1,250.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the species chain (`runspecchainedto`: CH4 and NMHC from THC, VOC from NMHC, the toxics from VOC, NO/NO2/HONO from NOx, SO2 from energy) at the two hotelling processes over the Year collapse, and CrankcaseEmissionCalculator chaining crankcase extended idle's species from extended idle's. AND ITS ABSENCES: crankcase running and start are selected without their parents (running and start exhaust), and MOVES writes NO crankcase running or start row -- nor an NH3 row at APU or crankcase extended idle; the model writes none either.\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1; `db_aggregationmonth` and `db_rateday` are read from its XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py` and `tools/runspec-day-selection.py`. `n_outputRate` is bound to 3898; `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.\n\nWHAT IT WAITS ON (PLAN.md §7.3.69, measured 2026-11-12, 10 min 20 s at 16.7 GB): NOT the Year collapse. The model emits 2,214 rows against MOVES's 3,898 and 2,164 share a key: the species chain at the hotelling processes is deeper than the three rungs the model unrolls (`run_chainDepthExceeded` 2,444: THC -> NMHC -> VOC -> toxic at extended idle, then crankcase extended idle's copy of each), APU's species chain emits on 164 of MOVES's 1,148 keys and 1,684 rows land on a process 7807 / road type 0 key no relation should hold, crankcase extended idle's CH4, NMHC, NMOG and VOC are 4x to 100x off, and `run_selectionUnported` counts 122 (crankcase running and start species beside road type 1, and the rest). The extended-idle toxics that do share a key are 2.99196 = 1/0.334229 high, AirToxicsCalculator's raw-share sum (finding F70), which the running and start ones the port fixes share. No species at extended idle, APU or the crankcase processes is checked by any capture at ANY aggregation; this is the first. Waits on a deeper unrolled chain and the crankcase and APU species paths; `run_yearUnportedSelected` keeps counting these pairs.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "output-time-step",
      "year-aggregation",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "nox-speciation",
      "crankcase"
    ]
  },
